{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>This mountain.</b> Mount Seir." "<b>Turn for yourselves northward.</b> This command was not immediate, until they finished going around the entire land of Edom and Moab. This is what it says: you are about to turn northward, and in the meantime, 'command the people' etc. And they thought to turn immediately, and therefore they sent to him to take permission to pass through."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:51:19.227601620Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}